<title>USA: Cascade Comms falls 6-1/2 to 80 after hours.</title>
<headline>Cascade Comms falls 6-1/2 to 80 after hours.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Cascade Communications fell 6-1/2 to 80 after hours, traders said.  </p>
<p>After the market closed, Cascade reported third quarter earnings of $0.21 a share, compared with $0.07 a share the previous third quarter.</p>
<p>Ascend Communications Inc rose 1-1/8 to 65-1/2, traders said.</p>
<p>Ascend reported third quarter earnings of $0.20 a share, including an $0.11 charge, versus $0.06 a share third quarter last year.</p>
</text>
